### Submit a new game to the platform
POST http://localhost:8080/api/dev/games
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Connect Four AI",
  "description": "A competitive Connect Four game with an AI opponent.",
  "rules": "Take turns dropping pieces. First to get 4 in a row wins.",
  "pictureUrl": "https://example.com/images/connect-four.png",
  "urlGameSession": "https://example.com/connect-four/index.html"
}
